			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766500101,
					"content": "~♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长翎鹮"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500102,
					"content": "…这不是朋友多不多的问题，就算是把整座希汐岛的长翎鹮都叫来，也不够把那面「盈月之镜」搬走的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500103,
					"content": "况且就算把它搬走，里面那一尊「月谕之像」也…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500104,
					"content": "！！！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盗宝鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500105,
					"content": "…挖走？我想，恐怕你也无法轻易将那面镜子搬走。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500106,
					"content": "♪♪♪♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长翎鹮"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500107,
					"content": "欸？你真的能把整座希汐岛的长翎鹮都叫来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500108,
					"content": "…它就算整个家族出动也没用…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500109,
					"content": "！！！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盗宝鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500110,
					"content": "呜哇，这里好热闹，怎么有一只盗宝鼬和一只鸟吵起来了…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500111,
						766500112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500111,
					"content": "难道是联合作案了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500113,
					"content": "准确来说，我们其实算是「谋划作案」，现在正在讨论「作案细节」呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500114,
					"content": "只不过，我的「同谋」们所想的方法，都有些太过直接了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500115,
					"content": "♪♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长翎鹮"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500116,
					"content": "好了好了，知道你朋友遍天下了。你到底是从哪里学的这个口吻…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500117,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长翎鹮"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500118,
					"content": "…那位戴着帽子的，矮矮铁胳膊女孩一直这么念叨？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500119,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长翎鹮"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500120,
					"content": "…如果你喜欢，就这么说话也行，但…和那位小姐相处的时候，也不必学那么多，好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500121,
					"content": "#接下来我要跟{NICKNAME}和派蒙谈正事，先安静一些吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500122,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长翎鹮"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500123,
					"content": "这只鸟真的安静下来了…呜哇，能听懂动物说话真好呀，我也想要这种厉害的能力…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500124,
					"content": "…小派蒙，相信我，你不会太喜欢这种能力的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500125,
						766500126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500125,
					"content": "这、这种语气…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500127,
					"content": "你误会了。我不是说这种能力会招灾引祸，或是叫人心神不宁…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500128,
					"content": "但…其实也算是让我心神不宁…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500129,
					"content": "当我发觉自己能够听懂动物说话时，最开始很高兴，但随后我就发觉了问题…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500130,
					"content": "这份能力，每时每刻都在起效，而且并不受我所控。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500131,
					"content": "欸…对喔，我都没意识到这个问题，菈乌玛能听懂动物说话的能力是不受自控的，那也就是说…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500132,
						766500133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500132,
					"content": "无论是林间还是水边…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500134,
					"content": "…我之前曾经听人说，在密林里听着鸟鸣，会感觉到林间格外幽静，心情也会变好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500135,
					"content": "但是，无论去往何处，我都…并无此感。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500136,
					"content": "待在林中时，我依然能听见野猫、兔子、凛角鹿、帔髦獾、长翎鹮的聊天声。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500137,
					"content": "它们大声讨论着谁把谁的窝啄塌了，哪里的树枝质量最好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500138,
						766500139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500138,
					"content": "耳朵一刻也闲不下来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500140,
					"content": "好、好吧…我还是不要这样的能力了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500141,
					"content": "早上被小鸟的叫声叫醒的感觉还算不错，但是…如果是被乱七八糟的聊天声吵醒的话，我的心情一定不会很好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500142,
						766500143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500142,
					"content": "鸟叫声也叫不醒你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500144
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500144,
					"content": "如今…我倒是已然习惯了。要是哪天早晨没有听见团雀讨论哪家的水杯最适合洗澡，反而有些不习惯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500145,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盗宝鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500146,
					"content": "#…多谢提醒，险些忘了正事。不过，既然{NICKNAME}在这里，我们或许不用采取那么…直接的方式了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500147,
						766500148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500147,
					"content": "我的朋友倒是也遍天下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500149
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500149,
					"content": "不用，我只需要你一个人来帮忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500150
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500150,
					"content": "我相信，以你的聪慧，打开那道由先代「咏月使」借由「盈月之镜」制作的封闭保管室…应该只是举手之劳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500151,
						766500152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500151,
					"content": "由先代「咏月使」制作的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500153
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500153,
					"content": "放心吧，对你来说，一定不会很困难的。来，我们一起过去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500152,
					"content": "我要求现场教学！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500153
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500148,
					"content": "就是可能要花点时间集结。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500149
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500143,
					"content": "好多次都是我把你摇醒的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500144
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500139,
					"content": "无论到哪里都很热闹呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500133,
					"content": "只要存在着动物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500126,
					"content": "这种氛围…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500112,
					"content": "然后还分赃不均。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500113
					]
				}
			]
		},
