					"content": "我们到了，你们所看到的，就是那面封存着「月谕之像」的「盈月之镜」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500202,
					"content": "那尊雕像很珍贵吗？居然用这么大的架势上锁…里面不会有机关吧？就是只要一步踏错，就会咻咻咻飞出箭来的那种。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500203,
						766500204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500203,
					"content": "我已经准备好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500205,
					"content": "安心，我已经提前让这孩子去看过了，此处封锁中并无那类杀机。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500206,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盗宝鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500207,
					"content": "喔！是盗宝鼬喔，确实很值得信任。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500208,
						766500209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500208,
					"content": "但它看起来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500210,
					"content": "呵呵，的确如此。每次拜托它帮忙后，下次再请它帮忙，我须得多付它一枚摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500211,
					"content": "还会讨价还价啊，不愧是「盗宝鼬」呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500212,
					"content": "不过，它帮菈乌玛守着那个「月谕之像」，是不是该换个名字了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500213,
					"content": "不如…叫「守宝鼬」好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500214,
					"content": "！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盗宝鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500215,
					"content": "嘿嘿，我可是会飞的，摸不到我啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500216,
					"content": "！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500217,
						766500218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盗宝鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500217,
					"content": "别往我身上爬啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500219
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500219,
					"content": "好了，在客人面前别太失礼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500220,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500221,
						766500222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盗宝鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500221,
					"content": "所以，我要怎么帮忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500223
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500223,
					"content": "唔，想取出那尊「月谕之像」，需得两人在不同的地方同时操作机关。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500224,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，请你们站到那片区域，负责操作那一侧的机关。这一侧则由我负责。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500225,
					"content": "可是，我们要怎么才能同时…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500226
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500226,
					"content": "无需担心，我在天上还有一双眼睛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500227,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长翎鹮"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500228,
					"content": "它会告诉我你的所在位置，还有面前的机关样式。放心，你只需要听我的指示行动就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500222,
					"content": "要怎么解开这个机关？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500223
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500218,
					"content": "至少别抓我头发…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500219
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500209,
					"content": "一定不会白干活…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500204,
					"content": "我已经习惯了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500205
					]
				}
			]
		},
