			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766500301,
					"content": "这尊「月谕之像」居然有这么大…确实无论是小鸟还是小鼬，都没办法把它弄出来呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500302,
					"content": "还被这么一面大大的镜子锁在里面…菈乌玛，这尊「月谕之像」很贵重吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500303,
					"content": "如果单论摩拉，我想它应该是值不得几枚的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500304,
					"content": "雕刻它的手法太粗糙，用的材料也是本地的普通石材…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500305,
					"content": "但对于那一代的「咏月使」，和如今的「霜月之子」来说，它价值千金。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500306,
					"content": "至少，在确定了这尊「月谕之像」的确存在后，我也能确定与之相关的一批文献记载的可靠性。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500307,
					"content": "无论如何，总算没有白跑一趟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500308,
					"content": "#谢谢你帮忙，{NICKNAME}。我果然没看错，这面「盈月之镜」难不住你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500309,
					"content": "你操作机关的手法，已经让这孩子佩服得五体投地了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500310,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盗宝鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500311,
					"content": "菈乌玛，它在说什么呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500312,
					"content": "#它说，{NICKNAME}取宝物的手段是它见过最强的，它愿意从此跟随{NICKNAME}，打开世界上所有的宝箱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500313,
						766500314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500313,
					"content": "怎么把我说得和贼似的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500315
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500315,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盗宝鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500316,
					"content": "「以后有什么打不开的宝箱，我会来请您帮忙的！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500317,
					"content": "走、走掉了…完全不给我们反驳的机会！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500318,
					"content": "放心吧。它不会每天叼着摩拉来敲你们的窗户，拽你们去寻找宝箱…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500319,
					"content": "也不会大半夜来你屋里，嘀咕着那些自己打不开的锁…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500320,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}！今天我们休息的时候，一定要锁好门窗啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500321,
					"content": "放心吧，那孩子没有恶意。只不过…稍微话多了一些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500322,
					"content": "好啦，我们一起回去吧，马上就是晚餐时间了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500323,
					"content": "对了，还要思考一下，怎么把这尊雕像运回书库里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500324,
					"content": "…看来，还是需要请几位和我相熟的朋友来帮帮忙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500314,
					"content": "虽然我确实打开了不少宝箱…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500315
					]
				}
			]
		},
